get around to posting/boasting about.

I used a female gnomish ranger - named, with no shortage of intended
irony, "Arrowny." It's ironic because - tee hee - gnomish rangers start
with crossbow bolts.

The Mandatory Artifact Weapon in this show was Magicbane. Not many
surprises there. However, I _did_ find Frost Brand in a barracks and
took it with me to the end, never once using it. (In a previous game
with this "Arrowny", Frost Brand was generated on level 1. I threw it
at things.)

I found another wand of wishing in the Valley of the Dead. I spent the
wishes on magic markers (-> scrolls of enchant armor) and wands of
death/teleportation for use in the late game.

Although this "Arrowny" character was only level 17, there was an
Archon in the Air Plane. I mean Plane of Air. I was too chicken to take
it on, though.

